## Visual identity to preserve

- Brand: **Garir Khata / গাড়ির খাতা**
- Primary: emerald/teal green (buttons, active nav, success)
- Icon mark: white motorcycle + spiral notebook/ledger on green gradient; blue mini bar chart on notebook
- Bottom nav: Home · History · **emphasized Add** · Reports · More
- Bangla-first labels where mockups show Bangla; bilingual patterns as in mockups
- Soft scenic Bangladesh-inspired header illustrations where present in mockups
- Category accents (e.g. fuel / maintenance / repair / other) as shown in mockups — not reinvented

## Related product docs (behavior, not visual override)

- Features: `docs/feature/Garir_Khata_Detailed_Feature_Spec.md`
- Architecture: `docs/design/Garir_Khata_Technical_Design.md`
- Sprints: `docs/plan/Garir_Khata_Sprintwise_Technical_Implementation_Plan.md`

If UX mockups and other docs disagree on visuals, **docs/UX wins**.
